  "description": "Lightweight, powerful and superbly equipped - the Sonic EVA SX is a sports bike for spontaneous fitness laps in the great outdoors and tough off-road tours. With the highly developed Sonic carbon frame with a geometry specially adapted for female riders and customised components as well as the particularly lightweight Bosch drivetrain, the e-MTB is ideally equipped for sporty challenges and plenty of riding fun. Elegantly integrated into the down tube, the expandable 400 watt-hour battery provides the necessary energy for demanding routes. The drive is controlled via the minimalist combination of handlebar remote and the system controller integrated into the top tube. The rest of the equipment is also optimally designed for sporty e-mountain biking with Shimano Deore 12-speed gears, a dropper seat post and robust Schwalbe Smart Sam tyres.",
